{"overview":"در جنگل اوکویای، کوکو کودک وحشی‌ای است که توسط پوکمون افسانه‌ای زاروده به‌عنوان پوکمون بزرگ شده است. او بزرگ شده و هرگز شک نکرده که خودش یک پوکمون است، هرچند توانایی استفاده از مهارت‌های پوکمونی را ندارد. آش کتچام و پیکاچو با کوکو ملاقات می‌کنند و به او کمک می‌کنند تا درخت بزرگ را از دکتر زِد، دانشمند فریبکار، محافظت کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"In the Forest of Okoya, Koko is a feral child who has been raised as a Pokémon by the Mythical Pokémon Zarude. Koko has grown up never doubting that he is a Pokémon even though he can't really use any sort of moves. Ash Ketchum and Pikachu meet Koko and help him protect the Great Tree from the crooked scientist Dr. Zed.","tagline_en":"A bond like no other...","runtime":101,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["矢嶋哲生"],"crew_en":["Tetsuo Yajima"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"松本梨香","role":"Satoshi (voice)","photo":"/8kGjV2Ke6MVaR2UGtO9YpFkvuTu.jpg","en":"Rica Matsumoto"},{"name":"ایکو اوتانی","role":"Pikachu (voice)","photo":"/my8LBLQ4MsK4hRz1PAATIqtieaI.jpg","en":"Ikue Otani"},{"name":"上白石萌歌","role":"Coco (voice)","photo":"/aBF4RdFWZbxyYVnQslgl3F5uCzR.jpg","en":"Moka Kamishiraishi"},{"name":"林原めぐみ","role":"Musashi (voice)","photo":"/3Alm4pmBIxpeeh0Sdippxdbkpne.jpg","en":"Megumi Hayashibara"},{"name":"三木眞一郎","role":"Kojiro (voice)","photo":"/yL9Tx2HZgK7t5AssYl6oGE9bjdj.jpg","en":"Shin-ichiro Miki"},{"name":"犬山イヌコ","role":"Nyarth (voice)","photo":"/bA6BQgafhEyRFMh4EbZQJqvIVWY.jpg","en":"Inuko Inuyama"},{"name":"中村勘九郎","role":"Zarude (voice)","photo":"/qnh2YMfGAg0HuXAyvd12pM9s6lZ.jpg","en":"Kantarô Nakamura"},{"name":"中川翔子","role":"Karen (voice)","photo":"/4ZBdHVfs9sezLiz1ixusv1wgT1Y.jpg","en":"Shoko Nakagawa"},{"name":"کو ایچی یامادرا","role":"Professor Zed (voice)","photo":"/biov5jENp2XYfehkcdnRvi796Wi.jpg","en":"Koichi Yamadera"}],"trailer":"ByzhuRr8StU","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/662708/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1